<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in paragraphs (1)(a), (b), (c), (e) and (g), and subsection (2) shall affect the rights to commence or continue any criminal proceedings or any action or proceedings by any person or body having regulatory, supervisory, investigative or enforcement functions of a public nature, where such action or proceedings is brought in the exercise of those functions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
