<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this section, the Minister, after consultation with the Minister of Finance and the Minister charged with the responsibility for companies, may amend the threshold referred to in subsection (3), by order published in the Gazette. Protection of creditors and other interested persons"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
