<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_22__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_22__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Court may impose such conditions on the grant of relief under section 19 or 21 as the Court deems appropriate, including requiring the foreign representative to furnish security for the due performance of his functions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
