<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_22__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_22__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Court may, on the application of the foreign representative or any person affected by the relief granted under section 19 or 21, or on its own motion, modify or terminate the relief. Actions to avoid acts detrimental to creditors"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
