<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsections (6) and (9), upon recognition of foreign proceedings, a foreign representative shall have locus standi to apply to the Court for an order under, or in connection with sections 352, 366, 426, 472, 528, 529, 530, 531, 540 and 541 of the Companies Act 2016 and section 20 of the Labuan Companies Act 1990."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
