<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3__para_e> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
