<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (2), a foreign creditor shall have the same rights regarding the commencement of, and participation in, proceedings under Malaysian insolvency law as creditors in Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
