<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection (1) shall not affect the ranking of claims in proceedings under Malaysian insolvency law, or the exclusion of foreign tax claims, social security claims or claims for employee’s superannuation or provident funds or claims under any scheme of superannuation from such proceedings."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
