<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (2), the claims of a foreign creditor shall not be ranked lower than general unsecured creditors solely by reason that the creditor is a foreign creditor. Notification to foreign creditor of proceedings under Malaysian insolvency law"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
