<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A foreign representative may appear in person or may be represented by an advocate for the purposes of any application made under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
