<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_34__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, on the recommendation of the Central Bank of Malaysia, the Securities Commission Malaysia, the Malaysia Deposit Insurance Corporation, the Labuan Financial Services Authority, the Companies Commission of Malaysia, the Civil Aviation Authority of Malaysia or other relevant authority, as the case may be, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedule to this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
