<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall apply only to cross-border insolvency proceedings commenced on or after the date of coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
