<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any cross-border insolvency proceedings or application relating to cross-border insolvency commenced before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall continue to be dealt with in accordance with the law in force immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
