<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in this Act shall affect the rights and remedies of any creditor arising or accrued under the law applicable before the date of coming into operation of this Act, unless otherwise agreed by the relevant parties or directed by the Court under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/21/eng@> .
